# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Biome formats to LF (see `formatter.lineEnding` in biome.json), so a CRLF checkout
# makes `pnpm run check` fail on every file at once — which is exactly what the first
# Windows CI run did. Declaring it here fixes it for contributors too, not just for CI.
#
# Nothing is re-normalized by this: every text file in the index is already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git neither converts nor tries to diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
